[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7622.55, "timestamp": "02:07:02", "text": "我之所以创作它，是因为我注意到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7624.87, "timestamp": "02:07:04", "text": "我所在社区的很多人都这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7628.47, "timestamp": "02:07:08", "text": "他们错过了某些直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7632.31, "timestamp": "02:07:12", "text": "有些东西看不了，还有所有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7636.55, "timestamp": "02:07:16", "text": "有不同的时区，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7640.39, "timestamp": "02:07:20", "text": "今年，也就是2026年4月，我将搬到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.83, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "日本。所以这是不可预测的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7646.31, "timestamp": "02:07:26", "text": "我自己都不知道这种情况是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7650.79, "timestamp": "02:07:30", "text": "如果我能够直播的话，我就有能力直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.27, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "为大家提供直播。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7656.79, "timestamp": "02:07:36", "text": "希望有一些东西能够面世，这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.229, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "你们可以通过我的存在来记住我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.79, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "我们共同拥有这些回忆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7667.35, "timestamp": "02:07:47", "text": "我想花一点时间……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7671.669, "timestamp": "02:07:51", "text": "澄清一些关于此的假设"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7674.47, "timestamp": "02:07:54", "text": "24小时频道并非如此。 [音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7676.069, "timestamp": "02:07:56", "text": "首先，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7679.35, "timestamp": "02:07:59", "text": "这个频道不是用来做农业的"}]